        "content": "## Send invoice notification\nInput: `status` (STORED|CONFLICT|REVIEW_REQUIRED), `invoice_number`, `sender`, `amount`, `currency`, `invoice_id`, `filename`, `issues` (array).\nOutput: `{ notified, channel, provider_message_id }`.\n\nSends one plain-text email through the \"Gmail (secondary account)\" credential.\nNo email body or attachment content is copied into the message, only the extracted fields and issue codes.\nSet the recipient in **Notification settings**.",
